flowchart TD
    A[Push / Pull Request] --> B[Build: go build]
    B --> C[Test: go test -race]
    C -->|passed| D[Deploy: alternate Blue / Green release]
    C -->|failed| X[Stop pipeline]
    D --> E{Health check OK?}
    E -->|yes| F[Current release activated]
    E -->|no| G[Rollback to previous release]
    F --> H[Monitoring result written to health.log]
    G --> H
